| Address                    | `textarea` | ❌       | Full-width (spans 2 columns) |
| Allergies                  | `textarea` | ❌       |                             |
| Medical History            | `textarea` | ❌       |                             |
| Emergency Contact Name     | `text`     | ❌       |                             |
